        <p>REPAIRS. Ticket Repairs by experienced Workmen m the premises, under the personal supervision of Frank and Walter Sugg. special attention can be given to Clubs who send the work at once. Reblade 7/0, 10/8, warranted thoroughly isofied Clefts ready for immediate use</p>
