        <p>BEGGING AT EARLEST9WN. At Warrington County Petty Sessions on Wednesday, Daniel Coulton, 34 years of age, was charged with begging in Bridge-street, Earlestown. Prisoner ad- mitted a number of previous convictions, and was sentenced to 14 days' bard labour.</p>
