      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-03-06_WidnesExaminer_art0129" n="art0129">
        <head>Headache</head>
        <p>Headache</p>
        <p>Its Effect upon Girls and How to Cure it by Dr. Morse's Indian Root Pills.</p>
        <p>THE girl who earns her living in shop, office or factory, has to be on her feet all day long. Oft she is racked with pain from her head to her heels. Could she go to bed she would do so, but the self-sup- porting girl has to think of-the morrow. Backache, Headache, in fact aching all over, she has to stick to her work. Dr. Morse's Indian Root Pills cure the cause of these aches. They make weak women. strong, and sick women well. In fact they are woman's best friend.</p>
        <p>A case in point comes from Blackpool. Miss F. Bergourz, of 15 Bonny Street, suffered much from Headache and Drowsiness. She says, " I Wa6 overcome daily by an oppressed and fired feelinz, and my future seemed black, dismal and dull. Dr. Morse's Indian Root Pills, howevf.r, altered all this. Now through their agency I possess the best of health and am once more in the finest of spiritr,."</p>
